{"overview":"Ranma Saotome, a teenage martial artist, and his father Genma travel to the 'cursed training ground' of Jusenkyo in China. There, despite the warnings of the Chinese guard, they fall into the cursed springs. From now on, whenever Ranma is doused in cold water, he turns into a girl and a cute, well-built redhead at that. Hot water changes him back into a man again, but only until the next time. To make matters worse, his father engages him to Akane Tendo, a girl who hates boys.","tagline":"","overview_en":"","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":16,"y":1990,"poster":"/3CrakbPBQ5P6j3p86zy4yqgu9Nh.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":161,"y":1989,"poster":"/lBYYap4PT81qXikSapJi8C5Pa7q.jpg"}],"episodes":161,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"山口勝平","role":"Ranma Saotome ♂ (voice)","photo":"/mJyxKRZxLv9D7LH5KcNSkjSKYOB.jpg","en":"Kappei Yamaguchi"},{"name":"林原めぐみ","role":"Ranma Saotome ♀ (voice)","photo":"/3Alm4pmBIxpeeh0Sdippxdbkpne.jpg","en":"Megumi Hayashibara"}],"trailer":"ykQrD1J09ts","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/57706-1-2/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Hulu","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/44uAnmSqvA4yBOdbPWN8YgQHjWm.png"},{"n":"Hoopla","kind":"free","logo":"/gtjNBzAoGgUtYzt0UKXmwG34WWL.png"},{"n":"Fandango at Home Free","kind":"ads","logo":"/wpOt6x0dRxTrIzuBosto4LGd7E9.png"},{"n":"Pluto TV","kind":"ads","logo":"/fN4czqaMQNLeF6sSSIjGbAWzvwK.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video Free with Ads","kind":"ads","logo":"/fuVBtr57kxnYzOILZ38xqSmBeyR.png"},{"n":"Tubi TV","kind":"ads","logo":"/9dEuvA8wg5TSeFBZlPxSVxFdimJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon MX Player","kind":"ads","logo":"/46U3TOB3PhVDjA7qaFOuYSaGMiq.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/57706-1-2/watch?locale=CA","p":[{"n":"Tubi TV","kind":"ads","logo":"/9dEuvA8wg5TSeFBZlPxSVxFdimJ.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXM